From 314f6efae951fc5ec94bc73696f96807a93465a2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: moto <j3tm0t0@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:29:47 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] bootwait: stacked Pico Z Loader lockup (emblem above "PICO Z
 LOADER")
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- The ring-with-Z emblem (88 px) is centred at the top and the one-line
  wordmark "PICO Z LOADER" (Orbitron 40 px: PICO black/white, Z
  black/light, LOADER bold/grey-blue spaced 6) centred under it;
  lockup 403x126 on rows 4-11 (no IOCS text there).
- Subtitle "for X68000 Z ・ Raspberry Pi Pico W / x68kzremotedrv";
  rows re-flowed: subtitle 13, title 15, status 17-20, track 23,
  message 25 (frame 2-28, bar 30).
- The logo is stored per horizontal band and per plane (empty planes
  skipped, identical planes shared) and drawn from a blit table
  (art_blits): 6.1 KB instead of a full 4-plane rectangle.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PrGdt1XK1exBgERrMmLA1u
---
 driver/bootwait.S            |  38 +-
 driver/bootwait_gen.S        | 936 ++++++++++++-----------------------
 driver/mkbootwait.py         | 110 ++--
 test/bootwait/waiter_test.py |   2 +-
 4 files changed, 420 insertions(+), 666 deletions(-)

